ok - a claude secondmate spawn arms the busy contract the stall gate can see, and Stop does not wake the parent
ok - a raw claude, pi, pi-signed, or omp secondmate launch writes no busy wiring and classifies unknown
ok - a claude secondmate's Stop guard records busy on a blocked Stop and idle on an allowed one, in any hook order, and a rewake turn reopens busy
ok - a claude secondmate whose home guard predates .fm-busy-stop keeps the Stop idle hook
ok - a claude secondmate spawn leaves an existing settings.local.json untouched
ok - generated Pi wiring gates stream observation and clears model phases without accepting late updates
ok - a pi secondmate loads the busy extension beside its primary extensions and does not emit a parent turn-end
ok - an omp secondmate names only the out-of-home busy extension and does not emit a parent turn-end
ok - an opencode secondmate plugin closes the parent busy record without a parent turn-end
ok - codex and grok secondmates stay on their existing verdicts and do not emit a parent turn-end
ok - pi extension reports agent_start busy, settles idle only via ctx.isIdle(), and keeps turn_end a notification
ok - pi extension awaits agent_settled before the next agent_start without a test delay
ok - pi extension events from a superseded incarnation are rejected as stale
ok - kimi and grok install no unverified semantic wiring and classify through their own gates
ok - opencode 1.x plugin classifies from session.status and ignores OpenCode 2 session.execution.* events
ok - opencode plugin classifies from session.execution.* (OpenCode 2), scoped to the latched worker session
ok - opencode 2 plugin ignores other locations' sessions on a shared server
exit=124
